  "id": "pesto-pasta-salad",
  "name": "Pesto Pasta Salad",
  "subtitle": "A bright, basil-forward pasta salad with toasted pine nuts and fresh toppings.",
  "description": "Cooked farfalle is combined with pesto, lemon, basil, tomatoes, sweetcorn, peas, and rocket, then finished with shaved parmesan or a vegetarian alternative.",
  "meal_type": "salad",
  "yield": {
